{
    "title": "Collectibles.com: Scan + Value",
    "description": "KNOW THE VALUE OF YOUR COLLECTIBLES, better organize what you collect, and share your passion with others on Collectibles.com! \r\nWith just a few taps, our AI-enabled photo scanning identifies any item and saves it to your personal digital collection\u2014featuring a custom Profile to show off your stuff! \r\nJoin our active community of like-minded enthusiasts, fostering new connections, sharing diverse collections, and learning from experiences. \r\nFounded by three guys who love the hobby, Collectibles.com is a new home for all who collect and our mission is to feed the passion.\r\nDownload the app now. It\u2019s free!\r\n\u2013\r\nCommunity: From trading cards and vintage toys to coins, comics, and rare sports memorabilia \u2014 and everything else hiding in personal collections around the world \u2014 Collectibles.com celebrates the passion, the history, and the personal stories behind every cherished item.   \r\n\r\nAI-Enabled Scanning: Snap a photo of any collectible and, magically, our AI-enabled scanning technology will identify the item and reveal an estimated value. You may be surprised by what you have!   \r\n\r\nCustom Profile:  Get your own address on Collectibles.com/YOURNAMEHERE \u2014 Proudly display your collections and share your passion with the world! It\u2019s your page to personalize, and it\u2019s free.   \r\n\r\nCollection Management: Organize and better manage all of your collectibles with ease, with details and images at your fingertips.  \r\n\r\nValue Tracking: What are your collectibles worth? Understand and track item pricing and know the total value of your collections with easy-to-use tools. \r\n\r\nDiscovery + Insights: Discover new collectibles, popular categories, market trends, and learn from the expertise within the community.   \r\n\r\nRewards: Earn points for your activities and contributions, and redeem them for valuable benefits and rewards. Our members are special and make the difference, so we want everyone to participate and share in the success. \r\n\r\nYour passion for collecting will create a uniquely rewarding experience.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://collectibles.com/terms-conditions/\r\nPrivacy policy: https://collectibles.com/privacy\r\n\r\nQuestions or comments? Let us know: support@collectibles.com\r\n\r\nFounded by three technology entrepreneurs who love the hobby, Collectibles.com is a Collectbase Inc. company. Formerly known as Cardbase, we began in 2020 as a valuation & collection management service for sports cards. We may earn an affiliate commission when you purchase through links on our site. This helps us maintain and grow our platform while keeping it free for general users. Thanks for your support!\r\n\r\n# # #",
    "descriptionHTML": "KNOW THE VALUE OF YOUR COLLECTIBLES, better organize what you collect, and share your passion with others on Collectibles.com! <br>With just a few taps, our AI-enabled photo scanning identifies any item and saves it to your personal digital collection\u2014featuring a custom Profile to show off your stuff! <br>Join our active community of like-minded enthusiasts, fostering new connections, sharing diverse collections, and learning from experiences. <br>Founded by three guys who love the hobby, Collectibles.com is a new home for all who collect and our mission is to feed the passion.<br>Download the app now. It\u2019s free!<br>\u2013<br>Community: From trading cards and vintage toys to coins, comics, and rare sports memorabilia \u2014 and everything else hiding in personal collections around the world \u2014 Collectibles.com celebrates the passion, the history, and the personal stories behind every cherished item.   <br><br>AI-Enabled Scanning: Snap a photo of any collectible and, magically, our AI-enabled scanning technology will identify the item and reveal an estimated value. You may be surprised by what you have!   <br><br>Custom Profile:  Get your own address on Collectibles.com/YOURNAMEHERE \u2014 Proudly display your collections and share your passion with the world! It\u2019s your page to personalize, and it\u2019s free.   <br><br>Collection Management: Organize and better manage all of your collectibles with ease, with details and images at your fingertips.  <br><br>Value Tracking: What are your collectibles worth? Understand and track item pricing and know the total value of your collections with easy-to-use tools. <br><br>Discovery + Insights: Discover new collectibles, popular categories, market trends, and learn from the expertise within the community.   <br><br>Rewards: Earn points for your activities and contributions, and redeem them for valuable benefits and rewards. Our members are special and make the difference, so we want everyone to participate and share in the success. <br><br>Your passion for collecting will create a uniquely rewarding experience.<br><br>Terms of use: https://collectibles.com/terms-conditions/<br>Privacy policy: https://collectibles.com/privacy<br><br>Questions or comments? Let us know: support@collectibles.com<br><br>Founded by three technology entrepreneurs who love the hobby, Collectibles.com is a Collectbase Inc. company. Formerly known as Cardbase, we began in 2020 as a valuation &amp; collection management service for sports cards. We may earn an affiliate commission when you purchase through links on our site. This helps us maintain and grow our platform while keeping it free for general users. Thanks for your support!<br><br># # #",
